pan\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e3\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e0\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e복귀 이벤트의 기간이 종료된 이후 이벤트 잔여 시간이 음수(-)로 표기되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e3\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e복귀 출석의 일부 보상 획득 버튼이 작동하지 않던 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e3\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e2\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e재접속을 하지 않고 다음 날까지 이어 플레이하는 경우, 미션 패스의 미션이 갱신되도록 기능을 개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e3\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e3\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e특정 상황에서 일부 블라블라 대화방에 입장할 수 없는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-fam